[
    {
        "content": "<p>This is a very minor issue about a potential mismatch between the doc-string of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=String.lines#doc\">docs#String.lines</a> and its actual implementation.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c\">/-</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Creates an iterator over all lines in {name}`s` with the line ending characters `\\r\\n` or `\\n` being</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">stripped.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The provided examples are</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">r</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">bar</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">baz</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bar\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"baz\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">r</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">bar</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">baz\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bar\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"baz\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">r</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">bar</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">baz</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">r\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"foo\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"bar\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"baz</span><span class=\"err\">\\</span><span class=\"s2\">r\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>which all work.</p>\n<p>Here is what confused me: first is the behaviour that I would have expected, followed by the one that is the actual implementation:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Possible misunderstandings</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"a</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"a</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- fails</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"a</span><span class=\"se\">\\n\\n</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toSlice</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 583932947,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775548679
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>In particular,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>if the string only consists of \"stripped\" characters, then none is removed;</li>\n<li>if there are non-stripped characters, at most one is removed from the end(?).</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 583933242,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775548767
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What I would have expected from the docstring is that <em>all</em> trailing <code>\\n</code> and <code>\\r</code> characters would be removed, and then the splitting into lines would occur.</p>",
        "id": 583933488,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775548828
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That doesn't make sense, an empty line is still a line. <code>a\\n\\n</code> has two lines.</p>",
        "id": 583934265,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Ullrich",
        "timestamp": 1775549063
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>So maybe I do not understand what <code>with the line ending characters `\\r\\n` or `\\n` being stripped</code> means.</p>",
        "id": 583934495,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775549143
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That is, the unstripped lines are <code>a\\n</code> and <code>\\n</code>, then the stripping happens</p>",
        "id": 583934527,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Ullrich",
        "timestamp": 1775549154
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ah, the <code>ending characters</code> <strong>of each line</strong>!!</p>",
        "id": 583934699,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775549204
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ok, I understand the docstring now.</p>",
        "id": 583934735,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775549218
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I thought that <code>ending characters</code> referred to the whole string, not to the characters in each line.</p>",
        "id": 583934824,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1775549250
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"634338\">@Michael Rothgang</span> If I understood your comment <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/37391/changes#r3035390847\">here</a>, I think that you also interpreted the doc-string as I had.</p>",
        "id": 583936001,
